  "description": "Qwen4-Max is Qwen’s next-generation flagship multimodal model, combining text generation, image and video understanding, and deep reasoning for software development, office work, frontend design, and complex agentic tasks. It supports web search, tool calling, and structured output, with OpenAI and Anthropic API compatibility, helping developers build intelligent applications with multimodal understanding and task execution capabilities.",
  "zhDescription": "Qwen4-Max 是通义千问新一代旗舰多模态模型，融合文本生成、图片与视频理解及深度思考能力，适用于编程开发、办公、前端设计与复杂智能体任务。模型支持联网搜索、工具调用和结构化输出，兼容 OpenAI 与 Anthropic API，帮助开发者构建具备多模态理解与任务执行能力的智能应用",
  "longDescription": "Qwen4-Max is Qwen’s next-generation flagship multimodal model, combining text generation, image and video understanding, and deep reasoning for software development, office work, frontend design, and complex agentic tasks. It supports web search, tool calling, and structured output, with OpenAI and Anthropic API compatibility, helping developers build intelligent applications with multimodal understanding and task execution capabilities.",
